{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-27","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":27,"points":null,"unitId":"ecology","unitLabel":"진화·생태·행동","topic":"상호작용","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["ecology","gene","development"],"stem":"애기장대의꽃은그림(가)처럼4부위로배열되어있다. 꽃기관\n발생은기본적으로3종류호메오유전자(homeotic gene)의작용\n결과로알려져있으며, 그림(나)와같은‘ABC 모델’로설명이가능\n하다.\n－ABC 모델의설명－\n◦호메오유전자A, B, C가단독또는상호작용하여해당\n하는꽃기관들의위치를결정한다.\n◦A 유전자와B 유전자가상호작용하여Ⅱ위치에꽃잎이\n형성된다.\n◦A 유전자는Ⅰ과Ⅱ위치에서C 유전자의작용을억제하고,\nC 유전자는Ⅲ과Ⅳ위치에서A 유전자의작용을억제한다.\n위의모델에기초하여유전자기능이결핍된돌연변이체에서생기는\n꽃의형태를옳게설명한것은?","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"A 유전자의돌연변이체는Ⅰ위치에꽃받침이생긴다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":2,"text":"A 유전자의돌연변이체는Ⅱ위치에수술이생긴다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":3,"text":"B 유전자의돌연변이체는Ⅰ위치에암술이생긴다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":4,"text":"B 유전자의돌연변이체는Ⅲ위치에꽃잎이생긴다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":5,"text":"C 유전자의돌연변이체는Ⅳ위치에암술이생긴다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":651,"height":262,"region":0,"bbox":[39.256,82.62,260.4,104.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-27/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":341,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,198.22,308.8,136.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-27/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.18,416.5,632.337],"width":333.756,"height":480.157,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[39.256,82.62,260.4,104.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,198.22,308.8,136.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","